                        "entry_id": "533f13db-8977-34be-ba18-2ddb30b44950",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of кня́жич (knjážič): princess (unmarried daughter of a prince)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
